  "selection_guidance": [
    "Always filter Scenario, Year, and Month for financial cubes; default to current_period_defaults when not specified.",
    "Use 'Consol GL Group' for consolidated group reporting; use 'Consol GL Company' for single-entity analysis.",
    "For intercompany elimination analysis, prefer 'Consol GL Elimination Reconciliation' with Elimination Type and Intercompany Category filters.",
    "When querying ownership or consolidation method, use 'Consol Definition Group' rather than GL cubes.",
    "Period Type dimension has only 'Current' and 'YTD'; always specify which is needed for balance-type accounts.",
    "For forecast questions, check Version dimension in 'SLIM Forecast PnL'; default to FINAL unless user specifies a draft version.",
    "Segment dimensions (1–4) represent cost centre, property/hotel, project, and sub-segment hierarchies respectively.",
    "Reconciliation and rounding check cubes are diagnostic; do not use them as primary financial data sources.",
    "For financial statement questions, use finance_semantics to choose the matched cube and put the mapped line_item_dimension on ROWS."
  ],
